MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Cure the Genome Mission
  missionName: Cure the Genome
  description: The mutations are advancing faster than ordinary treatment can follow. Complete the Genome Stabilization crisis project and develop a systematic means of halting the uncontrolled genetic changes.
  flavorText: What began as biological experimentation has become a problem written into the machinery of life itself. Destroying altered organisms may contain individual outbreaks, but it cannot explain why stable genomes continue changing long after the original interventions ended. Laboratories across the civilization will pool sequencing data, failed treatments, tissue samples, and every scrap of research produced since the crisis began. The objective is not to recreate the world exactly as it existed before the disaster; some changes may already be irreversible. We need something more practical: a way to stop uncontrolled mutation from producing another generation of surprises. For once, the answer will not come from stronger walls or larger armies. It will come from understanding precisely what we changed.
  participantRole: 0
  strategyTags: 4
